ading a file than encoding the same music in separate parts, so its use is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"preferred in this situation if feasible. A regular staff is the standard default staff-type."}]},"doc://IvorMXL/SQ":{"type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/SQ","title":"Swift.Equatable"},"doc://IvorMXL/SH":{"type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/SH","title":"Swift.Hashable"}}}